        <h1>Language Re-generation: An investigation into information locality effects on reconstruction</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A full project walkthrough of the hypotheses, experiments, findings, and examples behind teaching GPT-2 to translate impossible language back into ordinary English.</p>

        <div class="article-meta">
          <span class="date">April 2026</span>
          <span class="sep">&middot;</span>
