        <h2 id="setup"><span class="step-num">04</span> Data, models, and training setup</h2>

        <p>The project uses two BabyLM-derived sources because sentence length is part of the story: <em>bnc_spoken</em>, which is shorter and noisier, and <em>Gutenberg</em>, which is longer and more syntactically complete.</p>

