        </div>
        <div class="demo-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="demo-sentence">
          <div class="demo-label perturbed">WordHop</div>
          <div class="demo-text">It be nice in there <span class="tok-s">S</span></div>
        </div>

        <p>If the locality account is right, WordHop should be the easiest condition of all — and it is, on every measure we have:</p>

